<title>USA: Mutual Risk Management to acquire API.</title>
<headline>Mutual Risk Management to acquire API.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mutual Risk Management Ltd said on Tuesday it agreed to acquire American Policyholders' Insurance Co (API) for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Mutual, based in Bermuda, said in a news release that it intends to change API's name to Villanova Insurance Co.</p>
<p>API is a wholly owned subidiary of American Mutual Liability Insurance Co, which according to Mutual Risk is under the receivership of the Massachusetts Division of Insurance.</p>
<p>The deal is subject to approval by a court and the Division of Insurance.</p>
</text>
